category: Libs
requires: libicu-devel libnuspell5 pkg-config
sdesc: "Free and open source C++ spell checking library (development)"
ldesc: "Nuspell is a spell checker library and command-line program designed for
languages with rich morphology and complex word compounding. Nuspell is a pure
C++ re-implementation of Hunspell."
external-source: nuspell

